{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"09788: Employed persons, by sex and occupation. Annual average 2011-2025","source":"Statistics Norway","updated":"2026-02-11T07:00:00Z","link":{"related":[{"extension":{"relation":"statistics-homepage","metaid":"KORTNAVN:aku"},"href":"https://www.ssb.no/en/aku","label":"Statistics page","type":"text/html"},{"extension":{"relation":"about-statistics","metaid":"KORTNAVN:aku"},"href":"https://www.ssb.no/en/aku#om-statistikken","label":"Definitions and explanations","type":"text/html"}]},"note":["The figures in the table covers persons aged 15-74 years.","A major restructuring of the LFS was carried out from January 2021, see [About the statistics](https://www.ssb.no/en/aku) for more information. Consequently, the number of persons aged 15-74 was reduced by 26 700 in the new LFS. The restructuring also led to a break in the number of employed persons calculated to 21 900 and a break in the number of unemployed persons calculated to 5 400 (both estimates, the last one not significant). The number of persons outside the labour force was redused by 54 000. The use of proxy interviewing ceased in 2021. This change seem to have given a break in some variables among young people.","The table has been updated with new figures for the years 2021 and 2022. Previously, information about the occupation of employees working for temporary employment agencies only included in the occupational group 'Other occupations'. The figures have now been updated, so that information on occupation for this group is also included. As a result, the number of employees in the occupational group 'Other occupations' has been reduced. The occupational group 'All occupations' is unchanged."],"role":{"time":["Tid"],"metric":["ContentsCode"]},"id":["Kjonn","Yrke","ContentsCode","Tid"],"size":[3,11,2,15],"dimension":{"Kjonn":{"label":"sex","category":{"index":{"0":0,"2":1,"1":2},"label":{"0":"Both sexes","2":"Females","1":"Males"}},"extension":{"elimination":tr